<item><title>Lusófona University awards Germano Almeida its first honorary doctorate</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/lusofona-university-awards-germano-almeida-its-first-5fe751/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/lusofona-university-awards-germano-almeida-its-first-5fe751/</guid><category>Cabo Verde</category><description>The Cape Verdean writer, who won the Camões Prize in 2018, is to receive the title in Mindelo on Friday at 16:00.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 09:08:51 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" length="34079" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Cape Verde regulator urges rules that protect consumers and steady companies</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-regulator-urges-rules-that-protect-consumers-and-d514f1/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-regulator-urges-rules-that-protect-consumers-and-d514f1/</guid><category>Cabo Verde</category><description>Speaking at a conference during the 29th edition of Cape Verde&apos;s Investment and Business Fair (FIC), Leonilde dos Santos said regulation should be transparent and proportionate.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:20:19 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" length="34079" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>CVsky puts 72-seat ATR 72-600 into domestic service on Praia–Boa Vista</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cvsky-puts-72-seat-atr-72-600-into-domestic-service-on-a19aa4/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cvsky-puts-72-seat-atr-72-600-into-domestic-service-on-a19aa4/</guid><category>Cabo Verde</category><description>The airline&apos;s new aircraft makes its first domestic flight as CVsky adds capacity to links between Cape Verde&apos;s islands.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 13:53:27 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" length="34079" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Cape Verde import prices rise 2.9% in October</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-import-prices-rise-2-9-in-october-d40c1a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-import-prices-rise-2-9-in-october-d40c1a/</guid><category>Cabo Verde</category><description>Intermediate goods rose 5.8% and fuels 4.2%, while prices for construction-related processed goods climbed 15.6%.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 10:34:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-import-prices-rise-2-9-in-october-d40c1a/share.jpg" length="37896" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-import-prices-rise-2-9-in-october-d40c1a/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Cape Verde’s prime minister calls for closer government-business ties</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-s-prime-minister-calls-for-closer-government-f921a4/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-s-prime-minister-calls-for-closer-government-f921a4/</guid><category>Cabo Verde</category><description>Francisco Carvalho said the government is reviewing industrial policy and trade laws to support local production and make Cape Verdean goods more competitive.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 09:35:04 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" length="34079" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
